    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Collection of files and information for the computer game SimCity (Maxis/Brøderbund, 1989) designated for Stanford Digital Repository.  This collection is part of the Preserving Virtual Worlds project, funded by the U.S. Library of Congress, 2008-2010.\r\n\r\nThe computer game SimCity (Maxis/Brøderbund, 1989) is captured for preservation as a disc image of the original software and images of the physical carrier. The collection manifest also includes links to archived web sites containing SimCity technical documentation, version history, marketing and advertising materials, videos of game play, biographical information about game creator Will Wright, and more.",
